Third-party components shipped with this example
================================================

1. crusoe_mill  (sdk/crusoe_mill-*.whl)
---------------------------------------
Crusoe's fine-tuning SDK, shipped here because it is in limited preview and not yet on a
public package index. Not third-party: it is ours.

2. The datasets
---------------
No dataset is stored in this repository. `prepare_data.py` builds them from their public
upstream sources, each pinned to a commit and verified by md5:

    openai/gsm8k               @ 740312add88f781978c0658806c59bc2815b9866
    legacy-datasets/banking77  @ f54121560de48f2852f90be299010d1d6dc612ec

Both are public Hugging Face datasets and are redistributed here only as the code that
fetches them, not as data.
